<title>HUNGARY: Hungary 12-month T-bill yield drops to 20.31 pct.</title>
<headline>Hungary 12-month T-bill yield drops to 20.31 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average annual yield on the latest issue of twelve-month discount treasury bills was set by auction at 20.31 percent, down from 20.45 percent, at an auction two weeks ago, the Government Debt Management Agency said on Friday.</p>
<p>    Total on offer	     15,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Total bids received	42,858.77 million forints</p>
<p>    Total allocated	    15,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Total issued	0	18,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Average annual yield	    20.31 pct</p>
<p>    Average price		     83.2341 pct</p>
</text>
